      "created_at": "2019-08-24T16:12:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I've found myself choosing backgrounds based mostly on which ones give me access to a more fitting principle.</p>\n<p>Here's an idea: When using the guided method, you may pick a principle from the categories provided by any backgroud/archetype that you rolled, regardless of which one you actually picked. Not sure yet how to adapt that to the constructed method, though.</p>",
